:''This article is about the Cat Unit. For the enemy, see [[Osamu Mikumo & Doge]].''
'''Osamu Mikumo & Cat''' is a [[:Category:Rare Cats|Rare Cat]] that can be unlocked by beating any stage in [[World Trigger Collaboration Event#Battle! Tamakoma Second's Leader|Battle! Tamakoma Second's Leader]] during the [[World Trigger Collaboration Event]]. He was added in [[Version 11.9 Update|Version 11.9.2]] for [[Nyanko Daisensou|JP]] and [[Version 11.9 Update|Version 11.9]] for [[The Battle Cats|EN]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 677
|rarity = RR
|name1 = Osamu Mikumo & Cat
|name2 = Osamu Mikumo & Cat CC
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Osamu Mikumo & Cat CC''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
Osamu Mikumo works best around the early to midgame, providing high base health and being immune to slow and knockback. However, since Osamu is a pure generalist, he lacks a special typing niche that lets him excel in specialized stages, especially in late endgame stages where enemies will tear through him in seconds. He also isn't effective at stalling in general due to his subpar cooldown.

{{Job|Classification = Tanker & Melee}}

